raph","text":"キャラクターは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の答えは..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キューティーハニー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でした〜(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハニーフラッシュ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒントの赤い髪の毛に惑わされて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤毛のアンっていう答えが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多かったなぁ(￣*￣)へへっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/07/08/8875952/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おしっ！この握手でもらった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パワーで明日からまた頑張りますっヽ(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんもお仕事にお勉強に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に頑張ろうね〜(((っ･ω･)っ"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-6931":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日パルコ劇場で16人のプリンシパル初日でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山のfamilyが来てくださってて、有り難う御座います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントで、行けないけど応援してるよ！っていってくださったかた！\nとってもとっても心強かったです！\nありがと御座います！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲間やfamilyの方々の支えや声援で、毎日少しずつだけど成長しています！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"努力！感謝！笑顔！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で頑張ります！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうか...まあやを声援してくださる方に、少しでも笑顔が届きますように......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は個別握手会ですね！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これない方で、会場にはいくよー！って方もいてくださいました\nそれもすごく嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやのために、大切な時間をあけてくれて\nありがとうございます！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとはいまだに緊張するし。ちょっと照れるんですが、握手たのしかった！\n沢山パワーもらったし！\n幸せでhappyな気分になった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服は次回のせます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"sorry"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも宜しくお願いします！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば、公演の\n本番前！\nれなりんがフルーツを食べてて、\n『みてみてー』\nってケラケラ笑いながらいってきた！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなりんの口に\nれいかちゃんの好きなキュウイを、縦に口にいれて\n一人でニコニコしてたよっ(o^−^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本番前に皆を和ませてくれました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時の写メあるんだけど、\nなんかサイズオーバーはれないんだぁー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次回はるねぇー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！\nどうでしたか？私のショートカットわ！？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では隣で、みなみが、あたしを呼んでいるのでここらへんで！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0013.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-11343":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も1日おつかれちま(*´ー｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日今日と、とっても暖かい陽気でしたね♪\n暑いくらいでしたが...何だかワクワクしちゃいます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、あみ、ちーちゃん、川後さん、まあやと一緒にディズニーシーへ行ってきましたぁー!*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日のために、春休みの課題\nすっごく頑張って終わらせたよ(^_^)v"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/04/05/7289923/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみとちーちゃんと♪\n三人ちゃんと収まらなかった(^w^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/04/05/7289923/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後のひなさんと♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/04/05/7289923/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやと♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなか全員入る写真がとれなかったので、少人数ずつで撮りました(*^_^*)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春休みということもあり、とっても混んでいたのですが、久しぶりのシーは\nすっごく楽しかったです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乗ったアトラクションは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊タワー・オブ・テラー\n＊センター・オブ・ジ・アース\n＊レイジングスピリッツ\n＊ストームライダー\n＊キャラバンカルーセル\n＊フライングカーペット\n＊シンドバット・ストーリーブック・ヴォヤッジ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"です＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈、ジェットコースター系大好きかもぉ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乗る直前に急に後悔の念が沸いてくるのですが、座席に座ってしまえば..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっふーぃ！(≧▽≦)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなります。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真撮影されるアトラクションでは、\nみんなで制服のマネキンポーズをしました!!笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢の国をしっかり楽しめたよ(*´ω｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも...現実の世界へ帰るときのあの電車の中での寂しさ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうちょっといたかったなぁ...\nさっきまで、あみもちーちゃんもまあやも川後さんも一緒にいたのに...\n一人ぼっち...(/´△`＼)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電車にゆらゆら揺られながら、眼を閉じると、アトラクションの揺れが甦ってきて、更に悲しくなってくるんです。。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またみんなで行こうって約束したので、今からまた楽しみっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/04/05/7289923/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑ディズニーシーへ行ったときの、お洋服(´・ω・`)*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして!明日は新潟県で行われる、\n「アオーレ1周年誕生祭」に出演させて頂きます!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はそのためのリハーサルがありました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで頑張りますので、乃木坂ふぁみりーさん!ひなちまふぁみりーさん!\nぜひいらしてくださいね(*´ω｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遠くから、お越しになるふぁみりーさん\n道中くれぐれもお気を付けていらしてくださいね(*^^*)\nひなちまってまぁす♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【4月2日 ひかりのさん】\n【4月3日 ずんきちさん】\n【4月3日 Damahoさんの弟さん】\n【4月3日 としきさん】\n【4月4日ごぼう男子さん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆Happy Birthday☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な1年となりますように..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"立ち位置、歌...しっかりと確認して\n寝ま〜す(#^.^#)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も1日頑張るぞぉー!*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-36077":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Merry Xmas✨"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ranze.terada/img/blog/ranze.terada/img/2016/12/24/8278490/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ranze.terada/img/blog/ranze.terada/img/2016/12/24/8278490/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年のクリスマスは\nサンクエトワールで\nイベントだったなーとか\n考えつつ懐かしい\n今年もクリスマスはお仕事です嬉しい✨\n日々感謝して\n生きていきましょう\n何もかも当たり前な事なんてないですからね、、、(..)\nすみません\nいつも真面目に\n物事を考えてしまいます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"《発売中》\n○LIZ LISA×My Melody 2016\nAutumn/Winter collection''\n○LARME　さん\n○MARQUEE　さん\n○グラビアザテレビジョン　さん（裏表紙）\n○EX大衆　さん\n○ヤングガンガン　さん\n○OVERTURE　さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニッカンスポーツ・コム「NEWSがとまらんぜ」寺田蘭世\n毎週金曜日配信\n寺田蘭世が乃木坂46内や芸能界のニュースを貪欲にキャッチし、らんぜの独特な感覚でどんどん発信していきます！\nhttp://www.nikkansports.com/entertainment/column/terada-ranze/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○OVERTUREさん\n普段出来ないメイクをしてお洋服着てその世界に入ってみたい(..)\n他にも乃木坂メンバー出てます宜しくお願い致します(..)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"OVERTUREさんの\n外国のファッション雑誌みたいなお洒落な雰囲気\n憧れていました✨\nだから今回\nOVERTUREさんに\n出れると決まった時は\n凄く嬉しかったです✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は玲香さんとペアで出させて頂いてます\n玲香さん大好きだから\n本当に幸せでしたー✨\n玲香さん大好き大好き✨\n二人ともほぼすっぴんです\nリップをささっと塗ったくらいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ranze.terada/img/blog/ranze.terada/img/2016/12/24/8278490/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンタさん\nプレゼント、、、(..)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"smartさんオフショットより"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ranze.terada/img/blog/ranze.terada/img/2016/12/24/8278490/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プレゼント　for　you."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年も\nそろそろ終わってしまう(..)\n2016年も\n駆け込みブログしようかな\n多分、また更新します"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-19709":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"堀未央奈です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の乃木坂ってどこ？で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10枚目シングルの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜発表がありました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は今回も選んでいただきました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3列目でみなみと2人でセンターを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"挟むシンメポジションです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9枚目で3列目になり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に私は選抜として成果を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残せているのかとか色んな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思いが込み上げてきました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもそんな事を考えて自分を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見直すうちに、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっとパフォーマンスを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"磨いて見ている人を惹きつけられる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"様になりたい！とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"挨拶や礼儀を欠かさないとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方との触れ合いを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大切にするとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ、握手会、番組、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雑誌などで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"［乃木坂46の堀未央奈］"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"として全力で取り組んだり..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうゆう当たり前だけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は1番大切な事っていうのが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あって私はそれを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張っていきたいなって思いました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもはふにゃふにゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニタニタ笑っているけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はテンションが高い時以外"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"基本静かで冷静に物事を考えたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結構真面目だねってメンバーとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にも言われる人間で..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前に出るタイプじゃないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"向上心はもちろんあるし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悔しさもあります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの皆さんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒にもっと上を目指そう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってくださるのが嬉しくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私ももっと頑張りたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルって裏で努力してこそ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だと思う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日の努力とか奮闘ってなかなか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"表舞台に露わになる事は無いけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地道に頑張った分、必ず身になるし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこにいても皆さんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見ていて下さるから私は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張れます♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方には"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも支えられっぱなしです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ちのこもったコメントを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読むと気持ちが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"通じてる感じがするし元気がない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時も皆さんの温かい言葉に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"支えられます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会でも皆さんの笑顔を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見るだけで私は本当にやりがいを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感じるしもっと大好きになる♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと私は1人が無理なんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"堀未央奈を応援してくださって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんは乃木坂46や堀未央奈を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援していて楽しいですか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心から楽しい！応援していて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかった！って言われるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも頑張らなくちゃ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして新センターは生田さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バレッタで私が選抜に入ってから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々お話するようになって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲良くなりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同い年という事もあって♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜になるとテンションが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高くなるコンビ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学業から復帰をして久しぶりに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に活動するのが楽しみです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miona.hori/img/blog/miona.hori/img/2014/08/04/8777326/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10枚目シングルは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1つの大きな節目となるシングル。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも乃木坂らしさを大切に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46というグループが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっと沢山の方に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛されるように頑張っていきます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん、これからも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援宜しくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京には相談したり遊んだり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"する友達も居なくて家族も居なくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寂しかったりするけど私には"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂っていうあったかいお家"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"があるから幸せです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miona.hori/img/blog/miona.hori/img/2014/08/04/8777326/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみが隣で心強い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名前が呼ばれた時みなみが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手を振ってくれ